forest-surges-cfp-top-12-texas-jumps-notre-dame","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Pawn shop fighting 'Gold Digger' trademark filed by Jordon Hudson's company","description":"A California pawn shop is opposing a trademark application for \"Gold Digger\" filed by a company connected to Jordan Hudson, then-companion of Bill Belichick.","published":"2026-11-18T00:07:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50514442/pawn-shop-fights-gold-digger-trademark-filed-hudson","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Anthony Olivieri","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma coach Venables shouts out Love's after Buc-ee's comment","description":"Venables showed love Sunday to Buc-ee's -- which is owned by an alumnus of the Sooners' next opponent, Texas A&M. So on Tuesday the coach repped the Oklahoma-based Love's.","published":"2026-11-17T22:23:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513199/oklahoma-brent-venables-loves-travel-stop","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-17T21:26:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"North Texas QB Tayven Jackson out with upper-body injury","description":"North Texas senior quarterback Tayven Jackson, who is sixth in the FBS with 3,005 passing yards, will miss at least the next two games with an upper-body injury.","published":"2026-11-17T20:53:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513204/north-texas-qb-tayven-jackson-upper-body-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Defiant Dabo Swinney says Clemson's 'gonna win a bunch more'","description":"Despite going through a self-described \"rough patch\" over the past two seasons, Clemson coach Dabo Swinney is resolute in his belief that he and the Tigers have a lot more wins ahead of them.","published":"2026-11-17T20:37:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512833/defiant-dabo-swinney-says-clemson-gonna-win-bunch-more","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5076950/kelley-jones","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kelley_Jones_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":21,"round":1,"team":"DAL","via":"GB","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Kelley Jones (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kelley_Jones_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-17T20:12:06Z","intro":"Kelley Maurice Jones (born March 11, 2004) is an American college football cornerback for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Jones attended Clarksdale High School in Clarksdale, Mississippi, where he played both defensive back and quarterback. As a senior, he passed for 558 yards with 10 touchdowns and rushed for 1,424 yards with 19 touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Jones played in three games and redshirted his first year at Mississippi State in 2023. As a redshirt freshman in 2024, he started four of 11 games and had 29 tackles. Jones entered his redshirt sophomore year in 2025 as a starter."}]}}